          "commands_changes": {}
        },
        {
          "id": 1140283885,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "I agree that we should focus on fixing Qt6 compatibility bugs and I'm not particularly happy about switching back, but #18476 is a crash bug which wasn't present in Qt5 and is fixed in Qt 6.2.6 (which we don't have access to) and Qt 6.4.0 (which is brand new). I suppose we could try to fix it ourselves by dynamically loading Qt6Multimedia, but that seems like it would introduce more problems.",
          "author": {
            "id": 860017,
            "username": "geraldcombs",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "Gerald Combs",
            "state": "active",
            "locked": false,
            "avatar_url": "https://gitlab.com/uploads/-/system/user/avatar/860017/avatar.png?v=1789801377",
            "web_url": "https://gitlab.com/geraldcombs"
          },
