        {
          "id": 1140709895,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "I agree. So the plan would be to switch back once we find out if 6.4.0 does not introduce any new issues right? \n\nBoy, this „we are no longer providing LTS versions“ thing of Qt is of to a great start already",
