  "changes_data": [
    {
      "diff": "@@ -18,6 +18,9 @@ __We no longer ship official 32-bit Windows packages starting with this release_\n If you need to use Wireshark on that platform, we recommend using the latest 3.6 release.\n wsbuglink:17779[]\n \n+* The Windows installers now ship with Qt 5.12.2.\n+They previously shipped with Qt 6.2.3.\n+\n === Bug Fixes\n \n // The following vulnerabilities have been fixed:\n",
      "collapsed": false,
      "too_large": false,
      "new_path": "docbook/release-notes.adoc",
